    "S3WAGE_PLANT_OLD_H2MT + Sewage_Plant_H2MT (panels_generic*); S3WAGE_PLANT_OLD_H2MT + Sanctuary_B_H2MT (floors\\rock).  Every repair bitmap is a stock MCC tag."
  ],
